  "title": "Protein Peanut Butter Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "description": "Tasty cookies with a protein supplement, perfect for people who work out and are grossed out by protein shakes. Can substitute flavored supplements for a fruity twist.",
  "authors": [
    "Cathy"
  ],
